name    animal
prog    animal example
# Animal guesses with the sample datafile.
rate    0.6
setup   builtin cd /dd/DOC/animal
wait    5
key     y
key     \r
wait    2
key     y
key     \r
wait    2
key     y
key     \r
wait    2
key     y
key     \r
wait    3
snap    guessing
key     \003
wait    2
expect  using datafile: example
